<title>BELGIUM: Belgian court searching finance minister's office.</title>
<headline>Belgian court searching finance minister's office.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The offices of Belgian Finance Minister Philippe Maystadt are currently being raided by Belgian court officials, Belgian television RTBF said in its midday newscast on Monday.</p>
<p>At Maystadt's cabinet, nobody was immediately available to confirm or deny the news or give further explanation.</p>
